  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Project3DGP.Game::Project3DGP.Game.Levels.Garden.GardenTutorial
  dialog: {fileID: 341500036}
  shot: {fileID: 1210270524}
  ball: {fileID: 1347358142}
  flow: {fileID: 0}
  lookText: Hold the right mouse button and move the mouse to look around. The line
    from the ball shows your aim.
  powerText: The marker on the left goes up and down. Click when it's at the power
    you want.
  clubsText: Press 1-3 or scroll the mouse wheel to switch tools.
  shotCostText: Every shot takes time. Don't let the cat wake up!
  goalsText: Reach every goal. The cup counts only when it is the last one.
  warningText: The cat is stirring... hurry!
  criticalText: The cat is almost awake! Finish quickly!
